# Real-Time Payment Gateway API (`server.js`)

Supported Providers: **bKash**, **Nagad**, **Rocket**, **Coinbase Commerce**  
Features: **Bearer Token Auth**, **Real-Time Webhooks**, **WebSocket Live Updates**

